{"button-labels-icons":"<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Button Labels &amp; Icons</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">ConfirmButtonLabel, ConfirmButtonIcon, and CancelButtonLabel override the preset copy. CancelFunc runs when the cancel button is pressed.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/display/confirmationDialog.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiDisplay.ConfirmDialog(uiDisplay.ConfirmationDialogSettings{\n\tIsVisibleTwoWayStatePath: &#34;isLabelsVisible&#34;,\n\tOnConfirmFunc:            &#34;runAction()&#34;,\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tHeaderTitle:        &#34;Purge Records&#34;,\n\tConfirmButtonLabel: &#34;Purge Everything&#34;,\n\tConfirmButtonIcon:  &#34;ph-fire&#34;,\n\tCancelButtonLabel:  &#34;Keep It&#34;,\n})</code></pre></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" x-data=\"{isLabelsVisible: false, labelsDone: false}\"><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"isLabelsVisible = true\" class=\"w-fit bg-red-800 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-1.5 py-2 text-sm gap-0.75 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-fire text-base\"></i> Open Custom Labels </button> </div><p class=\"mt-1.5 rounded-md border border-amber-400/30 bg-amber-400/10 p-3 font-mono text-xs text-amber-100 [text-box:trim-both_cap_alphabetic]\">Confirmed: <span x-text=\"labelsDone\"></span></p><!-- Modal Backdrop --><!-- Modal Container Classes --><!-- Modal Size --><!-- Modal Size Constraints --><!-- Modal Border Radius --><!-- Modal Shadow --><!-- Modal Ring --><!-- Modal HTML --><div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-100 flex items-center justify-center bg-neutral-900/75\" x-show=\"isLabelsVisible\" x-transition x-cloak un-cloak @mousedown.self=\"isLabelsVisible = false;\"><div class=\"relative flex flex-col gap-4 transition-all duration-300 bg-primary-900 text-neutral-50 w-[50%] h-auto p-3.5 max-h-[85%] rounded shadow-md \"><!-- ModalCustomHeader --> <div class=\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"grow\"><!-- HeaderBlock --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xl\"><!-- HeaderIcon --><i class=\"ph-duotone inline-flex leading-none items-center justify-center ph-question text-neutral-50 bg-neutral-50/20 p-2.5 rounded-xl\"></i></span> <h2 class=\"font-bold text-xl text-center\">Purge Records</h2></span> </div></div></div><div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"isLabelsVisible = false;\" class=\"w-fit bg-neutral-50/7.5 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-1.5 text-sm gap-0.75 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-full  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-x text-base\"></i> </button> </div></div></div></div><!-- ModalMiddleContent --><div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4 px-2 text-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-pretty text-xl font-bold leading-relaxed\">Are you sure you want to proceed?</h3><p>This action needs your confirmation.</p></div></div></div><!-- ModalCustomFooter --> <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-full\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"isLabelsVisible = false;\" class=\"w-full bg-transparent hover:bg-neutral-50/10  p-2 py-2.5 text-base gap-1 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md ring-1.5 ring-neutral-50/30 hover:ring-neutral-50/50 justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\">Keep It </button> </div><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-full\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"labelsDone = true; isLabelsVisible = false\" class=\"w-full bg-primary-500 hover:bg-primary-400  p-2 py-2.5 text-base gap-1 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-fire text-lg\"></i> Purge Everything </button> </div></div></div></div></div></div>","custom-message-header":"<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Custom Message &amp; Header</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">Message sets the note under the question. MessageContent replaces the whole question block, so it wins when both are set. HeaderContent replaces the icon and title block. Size sets the dialog width.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/display/confirmationDialog.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiDisplay.ConfirmDialog(uiDisplay.ConfirmationDialogSettings{\n\tIsVisibleTwoWayStatePath: &#34;isSlotsVisible&#34;,\n\tOnConfirmFunc:            &#34;runAction()&#34;,\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tMessage:        &#34;This action cannot be undone.&#34;,\n\tMessageContent: ConfirmationDialogDemoCustomMessage(),\n\tHeaderContent:  ConfirmationDialogDemoCustomHeader(),\n\tSize:           uiDisplay.ConfirmationDialogSizeLg,\n})</code></pre></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" x-data=\"{isSlotsVisible: false, slotsDone: false}\"><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"isSlotsVisible = true\" class=\"w-fit bg-secondary-700 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-1.5 py-2 text-sm gap-0.75 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-columns text-base\"></i> Open Custom Slots </button> </div><p class=\"mt-1.5 rounded-md border border-amber-400/30 bg-amber-400/10 p-3 font-mono text-xs text-amber-100 [text-box:trim-both_cap_alphabetic]\">Confirmed: <span x-text=\"slotsDone\"></span></p><!-- Modal Backdrop --><!-- Modal Container Classes --><!-- Modal Size --><!-- Modal Size Constraints --><!-- Modal Border Radius --><!-- Modal Shadow --><!-- Modal Ring --><!-- Modal HTML --><div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-100 flex items-center justify-center bg-neutral-900/75\" x-show=\"isSlotsVisible\" x-transition x-cloak un-cloak @mousedown.self=\"isSlotsVisible = false;\"><div class=\"relative flex flex-col gap-4 transition-all duration-300 bg-primary-900 text-neutral-50 w-[70%] h-auto p-4.5 max-h-[85%] rounded shadow-md \"><!-- ModalCustomHeader --> <div class=\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"grow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase text-amber-300\">Maintenance window</p><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Drain the edge pool?</h3></div></div><div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"isSlotsVisible = false;\" class=\"w-fit bg-neutral-50/7.5 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-2 text-base gap-1 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-full  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-x text-lg\"></i> </button> </div></div></div></div><!-- ModalMiddleContent --><div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4 px-2 text-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-left\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold\">Billing impact</p><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">Removing this record stops the metered plan at the end of the cycle. Invoices already issued stay open.</p></div></div></div><!-- ModalCustomFooter --> <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-full\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"isSlotsVisible = false;\" class=\"w-full bg-transparent hover:bg-neutral-50/10  p-2 py-2.5 text-base gap-1 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md ring-1.5 ring-neutral-50/30 hover:ring-neutral-50/50 justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\">No, Do Not Proceed. </button> </div><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-full\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"slotsDone = true; isSlotsVisible = false\" class=\"w-full bg-primary-500 hover:bg-primary-400  p-2 py-2.5 text-base gap-1 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-lg\"></i> Yes, Proceed! </button> </div></div></div></div></div></div>","header-actions":"<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Header Actions</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">ActionsContent renders custom controls at the end of the dialog header. The close button stays at the top right.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/display/confirmationDialog.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiDisplay.ConfirmDialog(uiDisplay.ConfirmationDialogSettings{\n\tIsVisibleTwoWayStatePath: &#34;isActionsVisible&#34;,\n\tOnConfirmFunc:            &#34;runAction()&#34;,\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tActionsContent: ConfirmationDialogDemoHeaderActions(),\n})</code></pre></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" x-data=\"{isActionsVisible: false}\"><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"isActionsVisible = true\" class=\"w-fit bg-sky-800 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-1.5 py-2 text-sm gap-0.75 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-dots-three text-base\"></i> Open With Actions </button> </div><!-- Modal Backdrop --><!-- Modal Container Classes --><!-- Modal Size --><!-- Modal Size Constraints --><!-- Modal Border Radius --><!-- Modal Shadow --><!-- Modal Ring --><!-- Modal HTML --><div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-100 flex items-center justify-center bg-neutral-900/75\" x-show=\"isActionsVisible\" x-transition x-cloak un-cloak @mousedown.self=\"isActionsVisible = false;\"><div class=\"relative flex flex-col gap-4 transition-all duration-300 bg-primary-900 text-neutral-50 w-[50%] h-auto p-3.5 max-h-[85%] rounded shadow-md \"><!-- ModalCustomHeader --> <div class=\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"grow\"><!-- HeaderBlock --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xl\"><!-- HeaderIcon --><i class=\"ph-duotone inline-flex leading-none items-center justify-center ph-question text-neutral-50 bg-neutral-50/20 p-2.5 rounded-xl\"></i></span> <h2 class=\"font-bold text-xl text-center\">Review Changes</h2></span> <!-- HeaderBlockActions --> <div class=\"flex flex-shrink-0 items-center gap-2\"><!-- Tag --><div class=\"flex items-center w-fit text-sm p-1 gap-1 border-[1.5px]  border-amber-500/20 bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-200 rounded-md\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-0.75\"><span class=\"\">Review</span> </div><div class=\"flex items-center w-fit text-sm p-1.25 gap-1.25 bg-neutral-50/10 text-neutral-50 rounded-md\"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"isActionsVisible = false;\" class=\"w-fit bg-neutral-50/7.5 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-1.5 text-sm gap-0.75 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-full  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-x text-base\"></i> </button> </div></div></div></div><!-- ModalMiddleContent --><div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4 px-2 text-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-pretty text-xl font-bold leading-relaxed\">Are you sure you want to proceed?</h3><p>This action needs your confirmation.</p></div></div></div><!-- ModalCustomFooter --> <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-full\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"isActionsVisible = false;\" class=\"w-full bg-transparent hover:bg-neutral-50/10  p-2 py-2.5 text-base gap-1 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md ring-1.5 ring-neutral-50/30 hover:ring-neutral-50/50 justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\">No, Do Not Proceed. </button> </div><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-full\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"isActionsVisible = false\" class=\"w-full bg-primary-500 hover:bg-primary-400  p-2 py-2.5 text-base gap-1 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-lg\"></i> Yes, Proceed! </button> </div></div></div></div></div></div>","header-text-styling":"<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Header Text Styling</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">HeaderSubHeading adds a line under the title. HeaderTitleColor, HeaderSubHeadingColor, and TextColor color the title, the sub-heading, and the block text. HeaderTitleOneWayStatePath and HeaderSubHeadingOneWayStatePath bind both lines to Alpine state. TextCase transforms the text.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/display/confirmationDialog.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiDisplay.ConfirmDialog(uiDisplay.ConfirmationDialogSettings{\n\tIsVisibleTwoWayStatePath: &#34;isHeaderTextVisible&#34;,\n\tOnConfirmFunc:            &#34;runAction()&#34;,\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tHeaderTitle:                     &#34;Reindex Storage&#34;,\n\tHeaderTitleColor:                &#34;amber-300&#34;,\n\tHeaderTitleOneWayStatePath:      &#34;headerTextTitle&#34;,\n\tHeaderSubHeading:                &#34;Runs in the background&#34;,\n\tHeaderSubHeadingColor:           &#34;emerald-300&#34;,\n\tHeaderSubHeadingOneWayStatePath: &#34;headerTextSubHeading&#34;,\n\tTextCase:                        uiToolset.TextCaseUpper,\n\tTextColor:                       &#34;neutral-200&#34;,\n})</code></pre></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" x-data=\"{isHeaderTextVisible: false, headerTextTitle: 'Reindex Storage', headerTextSubHeading: 'Runs in the background'}\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"isHeaderTextVisible = true\" class=\"w-fit bg-violet-800 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-1.5 py-2 text-sm gap-0.75 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-text-aa text-base\"></i> Open Styled Header </button> </div><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"headerTextTitle = &#39;Rebuild Search Index&#39;; headerTextSubHeading = &#39;Queued for tonight&#39;\" class=\"w-fit bg-neutral-50/7.5 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-1.5 py-2 text-sm gap-0.75 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrows-clockwise text-base\"></i> Swap Text </button> </div></div><!-- Modal Backdrop --><!-- Modal Container Classes --><!-- Modal Size --><!-- Modal Size Constraints --><!-- Modal Border Radius --><!-- Modal Shadow --><!-- Modal Ring --><!-- Modal HTML --><div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-100 flex items-center justify-center bg-neutral-900/75\" x-show=\"isHeaderTextVisible\" x-transition x-cloak un-cloak @mousedown.self=\"isHeaderTextVisible = false;\"><div class=\"relative flex flex-col gap-4 transition-all duration-300 bg-primary-900 text-neutral-200 w-[50%] h-auto p-3.5 max-h-[85%] rounded shadow-md \"><!-- ModalCustomHeader --> <div class=\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"grow\"><!-- HeaderBlock --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xl\"><!-- HeaderIcon --><i class=\"ph-duotone inline-flex leading-none items-center justify-center ph-question text-neutral-50 bg-neutral-50/20 p-2.5 rounded-xl\"></i></span> <h2 class=\"font-bold text-xl text-amber-300 uppercase text-center\" x-text=\"headerTextTitle\">Reindex Storage</h2></span> </div><p class=\"text-sm text-emerald-300 uppercase text-center\" x-text=\"headerTextSubHeading\">Runs in the background</p></div></div><div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"isHeaderTextVisible = false;\" class=\"w-fit bg-neutral-50/7.5 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-1.5 text-sm gap-0.75 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-full  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-x text-base\"></i> </button> </div></div></div></div><!-- ModalMiddleContent --><div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4 px-2 text-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-pretty text-xl font-bold leading-relaxed\">Are you sure you want to proceed?</h3><p>This action needs your confirmation.</p></div></div></div><!-- ModalCustomFooter --> <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-full\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"isHeaderTextVisible = false;\" class=\"w-full bg-transparent hover:bg-neutral-50/10  p-2 py-2.5 text-base gap-1 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md ring-1.5 ring-neutral-50/30 hover:ring-neutral-50/50 justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\">No, Do Not Proceed. </button> </div><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-full\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"isHeaderTextVisible = false\" class=\"w-full bg-primary-500 hover:bg-primary-400  p-2 py-2.5 text-base gap-1 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-lg\"></i> Yes, Proceed! </button> </div></div></div></div></div></div>","icon-on-left":"<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Icon On Left</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">HeaderIconPosition defaults to Top, which centers the icon above the title. HeaderIconPositionLeft places it beside the title. HeaderIcon swaps the preset icon. HeaderIconColor, HeaderIconBackgroundColor, HeaderIconBorderRadius, and HeaderIconPaddingSize shape it. HeaderSize scales the title and icon.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/display/confirmationDialog.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiDisplay.WarningDialog(uiDisplay.ConfirmationDialogSettings{\n\tIsVisibleTwoWayStatePath: &#34;isIconPositionVisible&#34;,\n\tOnConfirmFunc:            &#34;runAction()&#34;,\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tHeaderIcon:                &#34;ph-rocket-launch&#34;,\n\tHeaderIconPosition:        uiDisplay.HeaderIconPositionLeft,\n\tHeaderIconColor:           &#34;sky-300&#34;,\n\tHeaderIconBackgroundColor: &#34;sky-500/20&#34;,\n\tHeaderIconBorderRadius:    uiToolset.BorderRadiusSm,\n\tHeaderIconPaddingSize:     uiToolset.PaddingSizeSm,\n\tHeaderSize:                uiDisplay.HeaderSizeMd,\n})</code></pre></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" x-data=\"{isIconPositionVisible: false}\"><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"isIconPositionVisible = true\" class=\"w-fit bg-amber-800 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-1.5 py-2 text-sm gap-0.75 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-left text-base\"></i> Open Left Icon </button> </div><!-- Modal Backdrop --><!-- Modal Container Classes --><!-- Modal Size --><!-- Modal Size Constraints --><!-- Modal Border Radius --><!-- Modal Shadow --><!-- Modal Ring --><!-- Modal HTML --><div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-100 flex items-center justify-center bg-neutral-900/75\" x-show=\"isIconPositionVisible\" x-transition x-cloak un-cloak @mousedown.self=\"isIconPositionVisible = false;\"><div class=\"relative flex flex-col gap-4 transition-all duration-300 bg-yellow-900 text-neutral-50 w-[50%] h-auto p-3.5 max-h-[85%] rounded shadow-md \"><!-- ModalCustomHeader --> <div class=\"relative flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"grow\"><!-- HeaderBlock --><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xl\"><!-- HeaderIcon --><i class=\"ph-duotone inline-flex leading-none items-center justify-center ph-rocket-launch text-sky-300 bg-sky-500/20 p-1.5 rounded-sm\"></i></span> <h2 class=\"font-bold text-xl\">Icon Beside Title</h2></span> </div></div></div><div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"isIconPositionVisible = false;\" class=\"w-fit bg-neutral-50/7.5 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-1.5 text-sm gap-0.75 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-full  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-x text-base\"></i> </button> </div></div></div></div><!-- ModalMiddleContent --><div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4 px-2 text-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-pretty text-xl font-bold leading-relaxed\">Are you sure you want to proceed?</h3><p>Review the effects before you continue.</p></div></div></div><!-- ModalCustomFooter --> <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><!-- Butto